{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buggos 2 is a <strong>horde based auto-battler</strong> where you play as the evil sentient hivemind controlling the swarm. The Buggos are expendable and nearly endless, and many of them will need to be sacrificed to destroy the disgusting human menace. <strong>Prepare to control up to 5000 Buggos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1741803681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every mission you complete will strengthen the swarm. <strong>Spend evolution points to gain permanent upgrades</strong> that enhance your fighting ability. Unlock new bugs that specialize in building, swarming, tanking, or exploding the enemy to bits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1741803681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle the humans by swarming endlessly over the battle field. Take over strategic objectives that multiply the spawning rate of your hives. Wash over the human forces with wave after wave of Buggo flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/Fleshwall.gif?t=1741803681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The humans will also gain new technology and weapons to fight back as you progress though the campaign. However you can use their own technology against them. Each planet you conquer will provide you a random choice of evolutionary upgrades based on the humans technology.<br><br><strong>Demo for Buggos 2 Coming soon! Please Wishlist and check back often so you can provide feedback.</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2908500?t=1741803681","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2908500?t=1741803681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/6fe8a6cd350ba8ea023969d72e3a75f382c0fb42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741803681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/6fe8a6cd350ba8ea023969d72e3a75f382c0fb42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741803681","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3518880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buggos 2 is a <strong>horde based auto-battler</strong> where you play as the evil sentient hivemind controlling the swarm. The Buggos are expendable and nearly endless, and many of them will need to be sacrificed to destroy the disgusting human menace. <strong>Prepare to control up to 5000 Buggos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1741803681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every mission you complete will strengthen the swarm. <strong>Spend evolution points to gain permanent upgrades</strong> that enhance your fighting ability. Unlock new bugs that specialize in building, swarming, tanking, or exploding the enemy to bits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1741803681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle the humans by swarming endlessly over the battle field. Take over strategic objectives that multiply the spawning rate of your hives. Wash over the human forces with wave after wave of Buggo flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/Fleshwall.gif?t=1741803681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The humans will also gain new technology and weapons to fight back as you progress though the campaign. However you can use their own technology against them. Each planet you conquer will provide you a random choice of evolutionary upgrades based on the humans technology.<br><br><strong>Demo for Buggos 2 Coming soon! Please Wishlist and check back often so you can provide feedback.</strong> </p>","developers":["Intrepid Marmot"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/header.jpg?t=1741803681","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100183,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100183/movie480.mp4?t=1740006239","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100183/movie_max.mp4?t=1740006239"},"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100183/75b2ff4a92fbdb19267a3cc5684835b65136c513/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740006239","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100183/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740006239","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100183/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740006239"}}],"name":"Buggos 2","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit